# result, or 0 when the slot is unset. The carrier is an argument since
# v1.11.0; it is also parked in the global _propagator_extra for an inject_fn
# written as fn(data, context), and that path stays non-reentrant.
fn propagator_inject(prop, context, carrier) {
    _propagator_extra = carrier;
